      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Verification is planned",
      "items": [
        "A gate is planned only for a completed module, a change whose deviation would cascade into later work (such as a frozen contract or interface it feeds), or an unknown state",
        "One gate covers several authors; any other delivery goes straight to consolidation"
      ]
